# Scratch projects scaffolded by packages/canopycms-cdk's scaffold-synth test.
# Kept at the package root (never under src/) so a crashed run cannot leave
# stray files inside the lint/tsc globs.
packages/canopycms-cdk/.scaffold-synth/

# pnpm's content-addressed store, when pnpm places it inside the repo.
#
# Not hypothetical and not harmless: a globally-installed pnpm with no
# `store-dir` configured created a 21MB `.pnpm-store/` here, and because it was
# neither ignored nor prettier-ignored it broke `prettier --check .` -- which is
# the pre-push hook, so it blocked every push until the directory was moved out.
# It is also exactly the kind of thing a `git add -A` sweeps into a commit.
.pnpm-store/

